{
  "title": "Network Interface Performance",
  "uid": "nawari-net-perf",
  "description": "Hardware and interface performance monitoring. Explicitly distinguishes genuine SNMP metrics from unpolled candidate devices.",
  "tags": [
    "nawari",
    "network",
    "performance",
    "interfaces"
  ],
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "editable": true,
  "time": {
    "from": "now-6h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "refresh": "1m",
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "current": {
          "selected": true,
          "text": "All",
          "value": "$__all"
        },
        "datasource": {
          "type": "alexanderzobnin-zabbix-datasource",
          "uid": "PA67C5EADE9207728"
        },
        "definition": "Network Devices.*",
        "hide": 0,
        "includeAll": true,
        "allValue": ".*",
        "multi": true,
        "name": "device",
        "options": [],
        "query": "Network Devices.*",
        "refresh": 1,
        "regex": "",
        "sort": 1,
        "type": "query",
        "label": "Network Device"
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Monitoring Coverage & Protocol Status",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "title": "Telemetry Coverage Audit Banner",
      "type": "text",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 1
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "### \u2139\ufe0f Protocol Monitoring Scope & Provenance Audit\n\n- **ICMP Ping Checks:** Active for all 34 enrolled hosts via Zabbix Server (`icmpping`, `icmppingsec`, `icmppingloss`).\n- **SNMP Direct Access:** **Unavailable / Cause Unconfirmed**. Direct SNMPv2c/v3 requests from `mon-grafana01` timed out pending network ACL / community configuration.\n- **Synthetic Data Policy:** **Strictly zero synthetic trapper values**. Devices without active SNMP return `N/A (ICMP Only)` rather than fabricated CPU, memory, or interface counters.\n- **SolarWinds SWIS:** Standing by for dedicated service account authorization."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Genuine SNMP Performance Metrics (Authorized Devices Only)",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 5
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "title": "Interface Ingress / Egress Traffic (bps)",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "alexanderzobnin-zabbix-datasource",
        "uid": "PA67C5EADE9207728"
      },
      "description": "Genuine interface bits per second when SNMP discovery template is active.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 6
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "bps",
          "noValue": "N/A (ICMP Only - SNMP Pending)",
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 2
          }
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "group": {
            "filter": "Network Devices"
          },
          "host": {
            "filter": "/${device:regex}/"
          },
          "item": {
            "filter": "/Bits (received|sent)/"
          },
          "mode": 0,
          "refId": "A",
          "resultFormat": "time_series"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "title": "Interface Packet Errors & Discards",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "alexanderzobnin-zabbix-datasource",
        "uid": "PA67C5EADE9207728"
      },
      "description": "Inbound and outbound errors/discards measured via SNMP ifInErrors/ifOutErrors.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 6
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "pps",
          "noValue": "N/A (ICMP Only - SNMP Pending)",
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 2
          }
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "group": {
            "filter": "Network Devices"
          },
          "host": {
            "filter": "/${device:regex}/"
          },
          "item": {
            "filter": "/(Inbound|Outbound) packets with errors/"
          },
          "mode": 0,
          "refId": "A",
          "resultFormat": "time_series"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}